"Your claim of %(date)s is being reviewed by the platform, within 72 hours. "
"Your money stays in escrow with our licensed partner: the trader has no "
"access to it until the decision is made."

#: templates/vitrine/commande.html:147
#, python-format
msgid "Réception confirmée le %(date)s."
msgstr "Receipt confirmed on %(date)s."

#: templates/vitrine/commande.html:148
#, python-format
msgid ""
"L'argent sera versé au commerçant à partir du %(date)s ; jusque-là, vous "
"pouvez encore ouvrir une réclamation."
msgstr ""
"The money will be paid out to the trader from %(date)s; until then, you can "
"still open a claim."

#: templates/vitrine/commande.html:151
msgid ""
"Votre argent est en séquestre chez notre partenaire de paiement agréé. Le "
"commerçant ne le reçoit qu'après votre confirmation de réception."
msgstr ""
"Your money is in escrow with our licensed payment partner. The trader only "
"receives it after you confirm receipt."

#: templates/vitrine/commande.html:156
msgid ""
"Donnez-le au livreur <strong>seulement quand vous avez la marchandise en "
"main</strong> : c'est votre signature de réception. Ne le communiquez à "
"personne d'autre, ni par téléphone ni par message — HyperMarché ne vous le "
"demandera jamais."
msgstr ""
"Give it to the courier <strong>only once the goods are in your "
"hands</strong>: it is your signature of receipt. Do not share it with anyone"
" else, by phone or by message — HyperMarché will never ask you for it."

#: templates/vitrine/commande.html:161
#, python-format
msgid "Libéré au commerçant le %(date)s."
msgstr "Released to the trader on %(date)s."

#: templates/vitrine/commande.html:163
#, python-format
msgid ""
"La plateforme a ordonné le remboursement de <strong "
"class=\"chiffre\">%(montant)s FCFA</strong> le %(date)s."
msgstr ""
"The platform ordered a refund of <strong class=\"chiffre\">%(montant)s "
"FCFA</strong> on %(date)s."

#: templates/vitrine/commande.html:169
